#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:2
msgid "Internationalization and Chinese Builds"
msgstr "国际化与中文构建"

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:4
msgid ""
"The documentation source is written in English and lives under "
"``source/``. Translations are maintained as gettext catalogs under "
"``source/locale/<language>/LC_MESSAGES``. This keeps the English pages "
"easy to review while allowing Read the Docs to build a localized version "
"from the same source tree."
msgstr "文档源文件使用英文编写，位于 ``source/`` 下。翻译以 gettext catalog 的形式维护在 ``source/locale/<language>/LC_MESSAGES`` 下。这样既便于审查英文页面，也可以让 Read the Docs 从同一源代码树构建本地化版本。"

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:11
msgid "Chinese support"
msgstr "中文支持"

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Simplified Chinese locale is ``zh_CN``. The current catalogs are "
"stored in ``source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES``. All current user-facing "
"pages have Chinese translations. This keeps the published Chinese site "
"consistent while still allowing new source strings to fall back to English"
" until they are translated. The fallback is intentional: a new source "
"string must not make the localized site blank or fail to build."
msgstr "简体中文 locale 是 ``zh_CN``。当前 catalog 保存在 ``source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES``。所有当前面向用户的页面都已有中文翻译。这可以保持已发布中文网站的一致性，同时允许新增源字符串在翻译完成前回退到英文。这种回退是有意设计的：新增源字符串不应导致本地化网站空白或构建失败。"

