#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:33
msgid "Updating catalogs"
msgstr "更新 catalog"

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:35
msgid ""
"When an English page changes, regenerate the gettext templates and update"
" the Chinese catalogs from the repository root::"
msgstr "英文页面发生变化时，请重新生成 gettext 模板，并从仓库根目录更新中文 catalog："

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:41
msgid "The Make targets wrap these commands::"
msgstr "Make 目标封装了这些命令："

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:46
msgid ""
"On Windows, use ``make.bat gettext`` and ``make.bat update-po``. The "
"``sphinx-intl`` command is installed by ``requirements.txt``. Keep the "
"English source as the canonical text, translate only the ``msgstr`` "
"values, and preserve Sphinx roles such as ``:doc:`...````, inline "
"literals, option names, and code examples."
msgstr "在 Windows 上使用 ``make.bat gettext`` 和 ``make.bat update-po``。``sphinx-intl`` 命令由 ``requirements.txt`` 安装。请将英文源文档作为规范文本，只翻译 ``msgstr`` 值，并保留 ``:doc:`...``` 等 Sphinx 角色、内联字面量、选项名称和代码示例。"

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:53
msgid "Read the Docs setup"
msgstr "Read the Docs 设置"

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:55
msgid ""
"The repository includes ``.readthedocs.yaml``. It pins the build "
"environment, installs the documentation requirements, points Read the "
"Docs at ``source/conf.py``, and treats warnings as build failures. The "
"configuration does not create a language matrix by itself. In Read the "
"Docs, create a translation project for the Chinese version and select "
"``zh_CN`` as its language; the project can then use the same repository "
"and configuration while passing ``-D language=zh_CN`` to the Sphinx "
"build."
msgstr "仓库包含 ``.readthedocs.yaml``。它固定构建环境、安装文档依赖、将 Read the Docs 指向 ``source/conf.py``，并将警告视为构建失败。该配置本身不会创建语言矩阵。在 Read the Docs 中，为中文版本创建翻译项目并选择 ``zh_CN`` 作为语言；随后该项目可以使用同一仓库和配置，并向 Sphinx 构建传入 ``-D language=zh_CN``。"

#: ../../source/reference/internationalization.rst:63
msgid ""
"Before publishing a translation, run both language builds and inspect the"
" output for missing-reference or malformed-inline-markup warnings. A "
"translated catalog should be updated whenever the corresponding English "
"page changes."
msgstr "发布翻译前，请运行两种语言的构建，并检查输出中是否有缺少引用或内联标记格式错误的警告。对应的英文页面发生变化时，应同步更新翻译 catalog。"
